#15001
king welmar~
King Welmar~
King Welmar is here, old and grey, his eyes always on the doors.
~
Welmar is old now, his beard white, his big frame gone gaunt. He was once a
wise and well-loved king. Now he barely sleeps, eats only what his taster
has eaten, and sends every son and sheaf his realm can spare to the wall,
because he knows what will come east if Midgaard falls. He trusts no one at
his court, and he is right not to.
~
