ergan murderer~
Ergan the Murderer~
Slumped in a corner is Ergan, the Murderer of Townsbridge, smiling.
~
Ten years ago Ergan killed every soul in Townsbridge, two hundred and
seventy-six of them, in one night, and laid them face down toward the west.
He says he was asked to. He says it was a gift. He was a great warrior once,
and he is still dangerous, and someone at court keeps him fed and warm.
~
